&lt;li&gt;Own the technical strategy and roadmap for agent-driven cluster lifecycle management - provisioning, updates and decommissioning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner across teams to ensure new compute capacity is ingested on time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Align with partner teams on physical build-out and leverage cloud solutions to deliver high-bandwidth inter-cluster connectivity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with security owners to ensure clusters are provisioned secure-by-default&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and drive strategy on cluster scalability, homogeneity and fault tolerance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with cloud providers and internal research, inference and product teams to shape long-term compute, data, and infrastructure strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish and evolve operational-excellence practices: incident response, postmortem culture and on-call health&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the growth of engineers around you through technical mentorship and coaching&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
